{"id":"u165","kelas":"kosa","no":18,"judul":"Phrasal Verb Menengah 2: Kehidupan Sehari-hari","title":"Phrasal Verbs: Daily Life","emoji":"🪢","ringkas":"get along, run out of, show up, call off, calm down, grow up","ready":true,"goals":["memahami **phrasal verb menengah** untuk kehidupan sehari-hari","memakai phrasal verb tentang **hubungan, perasaan, dan rencana**","mengenali **makna harfiah dan kiasan**","menjawab pertanyaan dengan phrasal verb yang tepat"],"lesson":[{"t":"intro","text":"Phrasal verb sangat umum dalam percakapan. Di unit ini kamu mempelajari phrasal verb untuk hubungan, rencana, dan kegiatan sehari-hari."},{"t":"vocab","title":"1. Hubungan dan perasaan","items":[{"en":"get along","id":"akur / cocok","ex":"I get along well with my neighbours."},{"en":"break up","id":"putus (hubungan)","ex":"They broke up last month."},{"en":"cheer up","id":"menghibur","ex":"Let's cheer her up."},{"en":"calm down","id":"menenangkan diri","ex":"Calm down and breathe slowly."},{"en":"look after","id":"merawat","ex":"She looks after her grandmother."},{"en":"grow up","id":"tumbuh dewasa","ex":"I grew up in Bandung."},{"en":"make up","id":"berbaikan / mengarang","ex":"They made up after the argument."},{"en":"let down","id":"mengecewakan","ex":"I do not want to let you down."}]},{"t":"vocab","title":"2. Rencana dan kegiatan","items":[{"en":"show up","id":"muncul / datang","ex":"He did not show up at the party."},{"en":"call off","id":"membatalkan","ex":"They called off the match because of rain."},{"en":"drop by","id":"mampir","ex":"Drop by my house tomorrow."},{"en":"pick out","id":"memilih","ex":"She picked out a red dress."},{"en":"try out","id":"mencoba","ex":"I want to try out the new cafe."},{"en":"check out","id":"memeriksa / check-out","ex":"Check out this video!"},{"en":"hang out","id":"bersantai bersama","ex":"We hang out at the park."},{"en":"stay up","id":"begadang","ex":"I stayed up late to study."}]},{"t":"vocab","title":"3. Barang dan uang","items":[{"en":